  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPACT: 23-0001723 UN Multi-donor Trust Fund for Youth and Employment in Tunisia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPACT: 23-0001723 The main objective of the Fund will be: 1) to identify, exploit and concretize opportunities (support, integration, self-employment, and entrepreneurship) 2) to act on all the obstacles to employment that young Tunisians face and to have an impact on the categories most affected by unemployment and in the least favored regions of Tunisia and at high social risk</narrative>
  </description>
